STANDARDS DOCUMENTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The decoder was written from ETSI TS 103 190-1 and -2, which ETSI publishes
free of charge. The standards DOCUMENTS are copyrighted by their publisher and
are NOT included in or redistributed by this project. The files in
ac4/tables/ are numeric data only (Huffman code lengths and codewords, the QMF
prototype filter, the A-SPX noise table and scale-factor band offsets) --
never the document or its text.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
BROADCAST CONTENT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
No broadcast audio is included in this repository. The integration tests run
on captures the user supplies (see tests/capture_util.py).
